Server init.
>> a := Blob bag-o: 4.
a bytes: ( Lista bag-o ; Bin b00000101 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000001 ; 0).
>> b := Blob bag-o: 4.
b bytes: ( Lista bag-o ; Bin b00000110 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000000 ; 0).
>> c := a bag-o.
# inherited blob does not get the buffer, so it's useless
# it will pass ctr_accept() but since buffer ptr == null, it will return 0
{ Gawas isulat: ( a ^ c ), bag-ong-linya. } dakpon: { :e Gawas isulat: e, bag-ong-linya. }, padagana.
a buhii.
b buhii.
